{"repositoryId":1426185298,"availability":"available","full":"Vargas146/lintlang","name":"lintlang","description":"Static analysis for AI agent configs, tool descriptions, and system prompts — catches vague tool descriptions, missing stop conditions, and schema gaps before they reach runtime. Zero-LLM, deterministic checks, built for CI.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-19T21:12:40Z","updated":"2026-10-19T21:13:04Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://lintlang.ai/","topics":["agent-config","agent-linter","agent-skills","ai-agents","ai-audit","ai-reliability","ai-safety","claude-code-plugin","gemini-cli-extension","github-actions","hermes-labs","linter","llm-ops","pre-commit","prompt-engineering","prompt-linter","python","quality-gate","sarif","static-analysis"],"demo":"https://hermes-labs.ai/lintlang#playground","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T22:20:16.655Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T22:20:16.655Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T22:20:16.655Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T22:20:16.655Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Product page · Playground · PyPI · Docs · 简体中文","LintLang is a local, deterministic static linter for the instructions and tool interfaces an AI agent is given. It flags ambiguous tool choices, mixed output formats, schema gaps, missing bounds, and other setup defects before the agent runs.","Point it at a project directory. LintLang finds supported agent-facing content inside the files you already use: MCP and function-tool definitions nested in JSON/YAML, parameter schemas, system prompts, messages, output contracts, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, GEMINI.md, SKILL.md, and supported Python prompt code."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Vargas146/lintlang/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ee2c8726f456602329e9c3e0b2a02391f6fe14a348aa904695ee5a5c84a3afb7","extractedAt":"2026-10